            "sid": "ISA 22:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na makanĩka ĩũlũ wake ndaĩa yonthe ya nyũmba ya ĩthe wake, ũsyao na nzyawa, kĩla mũio mũnini, kuma ikombe kũvika masũva onthe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mũthenya ũsu, easya Yeova wa nguthu, mũsumaa ũla walũlũmĩlw’e vandũ valũmu ũkakũka; na ũkatemwa na kũvalũka; na mũio ũla wanĩkiwe ĩũlũ waw’o ũkavetwa; nũndũ Yeova nũneenete ũu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.25"
            ]
          }
